MAYNARD, Mass. -- September 8, 1994 -- Digital Equipment Corporation 
today announced the appointment of Jeffrey Low to vice president of 
sales and field marketing of the Network Product Business. Low will 
be responsible for all sales, sales support, field marketing and 
channels for the Network Product Business worldwide. The Network 
Product Business is a segment of Digital's Components Division.

     "As part of our strategy to drive business into new and 
developing markets worldwide, Jeff's responsibilities will include 
aggressively hiring a dedicated sales organization whose task is to 
significantly increase our sales to distributors and reseller 
partners worldwide," said Larry Walker, vice president and general 
manager, Network Product Business, Digital Equipment Corporation.

