DECwanrouter 90EW (two port) $2,250	    Available November 1994

     Digital was one of the original developers of many current 
networking technologies, such as Ethernet and FDDI LANs, network 
switches, routers, bridges and terminal servers.  The company also 
developed the first practical solutions to integrating the most 
popular industry protocols and platforms.  Digital has installed 
more than 110,000 networks and networked more than 1.5 million 
computers.

     Digital Equipment Corporation is the world's leader in open 
client/server solutions from personal computing to integrated 
worldwide information systems.  Digital's scalable Alpha AXP 
platforms, storage, networking, software and services, together 
with industry-focused solutions from business partners, help
organizations compete and win in today's global marketplace.
