Corporation today announced a new agreement with QPI Sales, a 
leading Southern California manufacturer's representative, to market 
Digital's Alpha AXPvme line of 64-bit RISC single board computer and 
realtime software to commercial and military OEMs and end-users in 
Southern California.  Under the terms of the agreement, QPI Sales 
